# Konfigurasi Layanan Resmi Google Identity Services (GIS)
# Dapatkan Client ID dari Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Buka https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Buat "OAuth 2.0 Client ID" bertipe "Web application"
# 3. Masukkan "Authorized JavaScript origins":
#    - http://localhost:5173
#    - http://localhost:3000
#    - https://lbb.tontimuallimin.com (domain produksi Anda)
# 4. Salin Client ID ke bawah:

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
